ke was found  by sengoku himself and taken in by the  Marines Drake eventually Rose to the  rank of rear Admiral before going  undercover to spy on the Beast pirates  in a very similar way that rosinante  went to infiltrate the Don Quixote  Pirates now multiple online sources  including the official one-piece Wiki  state that X Drake was taken in by  sengoku and raised as his son in exactly  the same way that rosinante was while  this is possible it is not technically  confirmed I checked with our tour from  the library of O'Hara website and  YouTube channel and he explained that  sengoku found the Drake picked him up  and assigned him to Marine headquarters  but the alleged father-son relationship  is not confirmed not even on the Weaver  cards I mean it could be a father-son  relationship but we have to acknowledge  that we don't have that official  confirmation even though some sources  have claimed that we already do oh and  definitely check out Arthur's Channel he  is incredibly knowledgeable about every  little detail of One Piece Link in the  description so considering the fact that  there is clearly a direct connection  between sengoku and Drake and  considering that the two of them have  known each other ever since Drake first  joined the Marines we certainly can't  rule out that sengoku may be affiliated  with sword this becomes even more  blatantly obvious if the two of them  really did have a father-son  relationship like sengoku and rosinante  and then Drake just happens to end up  with an undercover pirate Mission very  similar to the one that rosinante was  assigned to by sengoku himself if that  father-son relationship is ever  confirmed it will be almost impossible  to imagine that sengoku isn't the one  behind sword or at least that he has  isn't one of its leaders after all  sengoku's dislike for the world  government is well known he nominated  kuzan to become Fleet Admiral over  sakazuki and in general he has become  more and more disillusioned 