 sincerely doubt it GARP is  a character who still hasn't been fully  fleshed out his character Arc is  definitely not complete and I'm almost  certain that we will learn more about  the God Valley incident before the story  comes to an end an incident in which  GARP played a leading role so I believe  that GARP is absolutely affiliated with  sword and in fact he's likely one of its  leaders the true beginnings of Sword May  date all the way back to the god Valley  incident and once we finally get that  flashback ever everything will begin to  fall into place this brings me to  another fascinating character that I  think may be secretly affiliated with  sword and that is red-haired Shanks now  of course I don't think that Shanks is a  member or leader of Sword but I do think  that he might be some kind of affiliate  because there are some suspicious  circumstances surrounding Shanks that  need to be explored further for one  thing we now know that Shanks was  actually on God Valley as a baby and  that is where Roger found him and took  him in as a member of his crew GARP was  also there at the same time and fighting  alongside Roger so it is quite possible  that GARP has known Shanks since he was  literally a toddler then there's the  little matter of how exactly Shanks and  the red hair Pirates discovered the top  secret location of the gomungomunomi 13  years ago this devil fruit was being  carefully guarded by cp9 and it was  being secretly transported aboard a  government ship and yet the red hair  Pirates found it attacked the ship and  stole the devil fruit this very devil  fruit would later turn out to be The  Godly mythical Zone devil fruit known as  the hitohitonomi model Nika the same  devil fruit that once belonged to the  legendary Joy boy himself wow what a  crazy coincidence I wouldn't be  surprised if Shanks and the red-haired  Pirates were actually tipped off about  the top secret location of the  gomugomonomi because someone within the  Marines someone who is directly  connected to sword may have contacted  them soon after stealing the  gomogomonomi shanks and his crew arrived  in fuchsia Village and remained there  for over a year that is where they met  young Luffy who eventually ended up  accidentally eating the gomogomunomi but  isn't it kind of insane that Shanks who  was by then already a notorious pirate  and someone who directly attacked the  world government in the past decided to  spend over a year off and on in the  hometown of marine vice admiral Monkey D  GARP just drinking and hanging out with  garp's own grandson we have to remember  remember that fuchsia Village is not a  big place it's the kind of place where  everyone knows each other and everyone  talks to each other as soon as someone  like Shanks sailed into town everyone  would be talking about it and even if  they didn't know who he is exactly they  would be able to guess a lot by just  looking at his ship and his crew and yet  we are supposed to believe that Marine  vice admiral Garb the hero of the  Marines had no idea that the notorious  pirate Shanks was using his hometown as  a home base for over a year we are  supposed to believe that GARP didn't  realize that his own grandson Luffy had  befriended these Pirates and was hanging  out with them all the time if GARP  really didn't know this information then  that would make him not only a horrible  grandfather but also a horrible marine  officer the idea that GARP wasn't  collecting basic Intel about what was  going on inside his own Hometown where  his own grandson was seems absolutely  laughable to me and this makes me think  that GARP actually knew a lot more than  he let on in the past GARP has stated  that he hates Shanks because he blames  him for corrupting Luffy and setting him  on the path to becoming a pirate but his  hatred for Shanks could be just a cover  after all a young Ace just happened to  be there near fuchsia Village at the  same time that Shanks was there and Ace  just happens to be the only son of  Shanks as former Captain Goldie Roger oh  yeah and he just happens to have been  secretly taken into the care of GARP in  direct Defiance of the world  government's orders there just seems to  be too much coincidence here and I  believe that once we get the truth about  God Valley and garb's backstory we will  also learn a lot more about Shanks about  kuzan and about sword it's all connected  and it will all be revealed in the final  Saga of the story so with all of that  said what is sword anyway there are  those who believe that sword was created  by Marines who hate the world Nobles as  a secret organization whose purpose is  to overthrow the world Nobles from the  inside but that doesn't seem to be the  case because it has been implied that  cp0 is aware of sword's existence if  sword really was determined to literally  overthrow the celestial dragons we can  assume that tp-0 would have tried to  eliminate everyone associated with sword  a long time ago but even if sword isn't  actually some sort of revolutionary  secret organization it could still be  used for revolutionary purposes even if  sword was created by people like GARP  with a more humble purpose like for  example advancing the cause of True  Justice in the face of world government  Injustice and hypocrisy sword can easily  grow into a revolutionary organization  once the final war between the straw hat  Grand Fleet and the world government  erupts sword has important connections  within the Navy it has spies among the  Pirates and it is likely affiliated with  key figures like GARP kuzan and Shanks  among others as such sword could play a  major role in the final battle and  members of Sword could make up the core  of the new Navy command once the world  government is overthrown and a new Freer  world is created I believe that this is  exactly what Oda is planning to do with  sword and I think that he has been  planning all of this for a very long  time it's only 